# core/

- Edit here for cross-tool constants, types, RBAC, pure helpers.
- Paths: `core/constants.ts`, `core/utils.ts`, `core/types/**`, `core/rbac/**`, shared calculators/session helpers.
- Shims remain at `src/lib/*` and `src/types/*` — change the `core/` source, not the shim.
- Do not import from `modules/**` or `src/app/**`.
- Prefer new imports via `@core/...` when touching call sites deliberately.
